  "hero_headline": "全球 AI 泡沫担忧加剧，科技巨头估值波动 / AI Bubble Concerns Rise as Tech Valuations Face Volatility",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球焦点汇聚于 AI 产业的估值挤压与地缘政局的复杂演变。科技领域，OpenAI 营收预期的修正引发了市场对 AI 支出可持续性的强烈质疑，连带拖累全球芯片股走弱；财经层面，美国企业债市场正经历 AI 相关风险的重新定价，投资者避险情绪显著升温，资金加速从地产向股市流动；时政领域，俄乌冲突激化与美国对伊朗态势的波动成为核心议题，同时各国针对非竞争条款及劳动力市场的监管力度持续加码。整体而言，市场正从对 AI 的盲目乐观转向对其商业化落地能力与财务回报的严苛审视，全球经济在动荡中寻求新的增长平衡点。\n\nToday's global landscape is defined by the revaluation of AI industries and shifting geopolitical tensions. In tech, revised revenue projections for OpenAI have sparked widespread doubt regarding the sustainability of AI spending, triggering a sell-off in global chip stocks. Financially, the US corporate debt market is undergoing a painful repricing of AI-related risks, while capital shifts from real estate into equity markets reflect growing risk aversion. Politically, the escalation of the Russia-Ukraine conflict and fluctuating US-Iran tensions remain central, alongside tightening regulations on employment non-compete clauses globally. Overall, the market is pivoting from AI optimism to a rigorous scrutiny of commercial viability and financial returns, as the global economy searches for a new equilibrium.",
